														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1980841">
									

<p>Even just <em>regular</em>, completely mundane solitary confinement is proven to cause extensive neurological and psychological damage in humans. My assumption from the start was that all it is is the total sensory deprivation, and you go mad all on your own because that's what human brains <em>do</em> in those circumstances.</p>

							</div>

